cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article it accompanies."
title: "Kinetic model, assay design and parameter identifiability for fluorogenic haloalkane dehalogenase assays"
abstract: >-
  Mass-action model of a fluorogenic haloalkane dehalogenase assay including the
  covalent alkyl-enzyme intermediate, a dead-end inhibitory complex and
  spontaneous hydrolysis, together with the numerical analyses reported in the
  Supporting Information of Mion et al.: validity of the quasi-steady-state
  reduction, substrate depletion within the initial-rate window, and
  identifiability of the fitted steady-state parameters under the concentration
  design used.
type: software
authors:
